    {
        "content": "<p>There is a <a href=\"https://lean-lang.org/doc/reference/latest/Basic-Types/Strings/#raw-string-literals\">raw string syntax</a> if what you want is to evoid escaping :</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"s2\">\"this is also \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">valid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"s2\">\"#</span>\n\n<span class=\"s2\">#eval test</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 619654934,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1787866142
